# Optional local settings for `pnpm dev:worker`: copy to .dev.vars (never commit it) and uncomment.
# Without them the Worker uses the request's address and generates its JWT secret in local D1.
# Deploy to Cloudflare reads this file for the secrets to ask for, so keep the lines commented.
# PUBLIC_URL=http://localhost:8787
# JWT_SECRET=<32+ random characters, e.g. `openssl rand -hex 32`>
